meta {
  name: GET Protocol Version Events
  type: http
  seq: 14
}

get {
  url: {{baseURL}}/supplementation/protocol-versions/{{protocol_version_id}}/events/?page=1&limit=10
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

params:query {
  page: 1
  limit: 10
  ~action:
}

settings {
  encodeUrl: true
}

docs {
  Staff audit for one protocol version. Admin + associate. No X-Center-ID.
  Unknown version → 404 "Protocol version not found." Inactive protocol still loads.
  Same row as GET Protocol Events, filtered to protocol_version_id.
  Other versions and null protocol_version_id rows are omitted.
  page, limit (default 10, max 50). Newest created_at first.
  action: optional stored action code. Junk → 400 "Invalid action."
  Includes client_visible false.
  data[]: id, action, actor {name, roles[{id, name}]}, reason, client_visible,
  client_title,
  change_type, effective_on,
  protocol_id, protocol_name, protocol_version_id, protocol_version_number,
  before, after, created_at.
  protocol_name is this version's protocol name.
  protocol_version_number is this version's number. Both always set.
  actor is null when the event has no actor.
  name is first + last.
  roles are that associate's active care roles. An admin has roles: [].
  Stored supplement_id in before/after is returned as
  supplement {id, product_name, brand_name, form}.
  form is the stored code. Stored JSON keeps supplement_id.
  Env: protocol_version_id.
}
